listic New York City and now London's Big Ben. It's the perfect first experience to show off your new headset! \n{1145915837225515}\nBring friends and family together for great laughs as everyone\u2019s knees go weak on a thin plank atop the One Astor Plaza skyscraper and Big Ben!\n{1355526585684846}\n# Next Gen Realism\nWe set out to push the limits of what the most realistic plank simulator could be on next gen Quest hardware.\n{569899162336154}\n# Plank Variety\n6 plank variations including: Wood Plank, Glass Plank, Metal Grate, The Pole, Red Light Green Light and Roulette. More to come!\n{3774236396148078}\n# Three Environments Included and Counting!\nWelcome London to the party!\n{2231970060632455}\n# Health and Safety Warning\nAll users must refer to the in-game EULA and Safety Guidelines to limit the risk of injury or harm when walking the virtual plank.", "short_description": "Your next gen plank walking simulator, set high up in ultra realistic New York City and London. Bring family and friends together for this intense welcome to VR experience!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.gamedigits.co.uk/docs/PrivacyPolicyWalkThePlank.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "GameDigits Ltd", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.gamedigits.co.uk/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["S